          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "title",
                "kicker": "LIFE AT O3",
                "kicker_tag": "h2",
                "title": "We're fiercely competitive.",
                "heading_level": "h2",
                "heading_tag": "p",
                "add_description": true,
                "description": "From poker to darts, from quizzo to client work — we like to challenge ourselves and each other."
              }
            ],
            "image": 6846
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "title",
                "kicker": "LIFE AT O3",
                "kicker_tag": "h2",
                "title": "We work hard, no matter where we are.",
                "heading_level": "h2",
                "heading_tag": "p",
                "add_description": true,
                "description": "Whether it's working in the office, from home, or a mix of both, our team adapts and gets the job done."
              }
            ],
            "image": 6854
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "acf_fc_layout": "image_accordion",
        "acfe_flexible_toggle": "",
        "acfe_flexible_layout_title": "Image Accordion",
        "title": "Our values",
        "accordion": [
          {
            "panel_image": 6180,
            "panel_title": "Apply optimism",
            "icon": {
              "value": "None",
              "image": "None"
            },
            "text_editor": "<p>Be the change you seek in the world by sharing your enthusiasm, positivity, and good nature — one person at a time.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_image": 6184,
            "panel_title": "Trust in people",
            "icon": {
              "value": "None",
              "image": "None"
            },
            "text_editor": "<p>Assume positive intent by always treating others the way you would want to be treated — which includes the openness to have respectful, constructive dialogue.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_image": 6181,
            "panel_title": "Commit to community",
            "icon": {
              "value": "None",
              "image": "None"
            },
            "text_editor": "<p>Focus on values and culture alignment that promote diversity, equity, and inclusion inside the company and within our communities.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_image": 6182,
            "panel_title": "Embrace iteration",
            "icon": {
              "value": "None",
              "image": "None"
            },
            "text_editor": "<p>Believe in a world where opportunity for continuous improvement requires a strong sense of flexibility and willingness to grow from yourself and those around you.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_image": 6183,
            "panel_title": "Focus on the future",
            "icon": {
              "value": "None",
              "image": "None"
            },
            "text_editor": "<p>Rally ourselves and our clients to focus on what&#8217;s next by pushing boundaries and staying on the cutting edge.</p>\n"
          }
        ],
        "background_color": "black"
      },
